     that it requires one additional argument _d_i_e denoting the debugging in‐
     formation entry associated with the address range list.  In this imple‐
     mentation of the DWARF Access Library (libdwarf, -ldwarf), the argument
     _d_i_e is ignored, and function ddwwaarrff__ggeett__rraannggeess__aa() is only provided for
     compatibility with other implementations of the DWARF(3) API.

